<title>USA: Pan Am to be listed on AMEX.</title>
<headline>Pan Am to be listed on AMEX.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pan American World Airways Inc said on Friday it anticpates that its shares will be listed on the American Stock Exchange following its merger with Frost Hanna Mergers Group Inc.</p>
<p>The merger is expected to close early next week, Pan Am said.</p>
<p>Pan Am shares are expected to be listed under the symbol &quot;PAA&quot; on the Amex, the airline said.</p>
<p>Until the merger is completed, Frost Hanna will continue to be listed on the Nasdaq bulletin board, Pan Am said.</p>
</text>
